<div class="prose-club">
  <p>After your round, take time to relax in our refurbished clubhouse. Penn Golf Club boasts a traditional clubhouse packed with character: the rich history, the Ball of Fame, the Stowe Room and our meeting and function rooms.</p>
  <p>The intimate <strong>Stowe Room</strong> holds most of the club's much-envied winners boards and memorabilia of the great Charlie Stowe, the Black Country miner who became a Walker Cup winner.</p>
  <p>We also have a separate <a href="/hospitality/meeting-room/">Media Room</a>, ideal for business meetings or presentations, and a large dining room. Both can be hired independently or configured with the other rooms for any business or social occasion, from small meetings to large parties.</p>
</div>

